    0,                        !- ASHRAE Clear Sky Optical Depth for Diffuse Irradiance taud
    0,                        !- Sky Clearness
    ,                         !- Maximum Number Warmup Days
    FullResetAtBeginEnvironment;    !- Begin Environment Reset Mode

